# Module 2 REFERENCE backend source (the live app actually calls a teammate's
# separately-hosted HuggingFace Space — see api/README.md — this folder is
# unused source code, not a deployment). These specific files must never be
# picked up by Vercel's Python function auto-detection: api/requirements.txt
# would make Vercel try to build api/app.py as a Python Serverless Function,
# and its ML deps (torch, transformers, gliner, sentence-transformers, ...)
# bundle to several GB, far past Vercel's 500MB function size limit.
#
# We exclude these files individually — NOT the whole api/ folder — because
# api/[...path].js in this same directory IS a real, intentional Vercel
# serverless function: the TalentPulse data API (server/app.js).
api/app.py
api/requirements.txt
api/Dockerfile
api/README.md
api/.gitignore
api/data/
